-- An album cover: "Ember Season" by Vesper Lane (both invented). Full-bleed photo, warm grade, condensed title,
-- a sticker, a halo of text, film grain.
Let there be a flat canvas called album-cover, 1500 by 1500.
Let ember be #ff7a2f.
Let cream be #fff1dc.

Let there be a rectangle called photo, 1500 by 1500, at 750 750.
Print @hallows.jpg in the photo, contrast 1.15, saturation 1.2, focused at 0.32 0.45.
Make the photo 20% darker.

Let there be a rectangle called fade, 1500 by 640, at 750 1180.
Make the fade a gradient from transparent to #0b0604, angled 90.

Let there be a circle called orbit, 300 big, at 470 560.
Make the orbit hollow, 3 wide.
Make the orbit cream, 45% see-through.
Write "VESPER LANE · EMBER SEASON" called around in Martian Mono, at 470 230, size 26, curved 330, tracking 10.
Make the around cream.

Write "EMBER\nSEASON" called title in Big Shoulders Display bold, at 90 1200, size 300, leading 0.82, aligned left.
Make the title cream.
Make the title glow in ember, 60 wide.
Give the title a shadow, 14 down, blur 30, 60% opacity.

Write "VESPER LANE" called artist in Jost, at 96 1420, size 42, tracking 14, aligned left.
Make the artist ember.

Let there be a circle called sticker, 120 big, at 1250 300.
Make the sticker ember.
Give the sticker a shadow, 10 down, blur 24, 50% opacity.
Write "INCLUDES\n“Lanterns”\n& “Hollow”" called sticker-text in Jost bold, at 1250 285, size 36, leading 1.2, turned 12.
Make the sticker-text #1a0b05.

Write "LP · 2026" called catalogue in Martian Mono, at 1404 1420, size 26, tracking 6, aligned right.
Make the catalogue cream, 40% see-through.

Give the card a vignette of 0.55, in #0b0604.
Make the card grainy 0.25.
